#. module: pb_onboarding
#: model:pb.journey.template,name:pb_onboarding.journey_template_rize_onboarding
msgid "New joiner — the full welcome"
msgstr "Karyawan baru — sambutan lengkap"

#. module: pb_onboarding
#: model:pb.journey.template.step,name:pb_onboarding.step_rize_buddy
msgid "Choose their buddy"
msgstr "Pilih pendamping"

#. module: pb_onboarding
#: model:pb.journey.template.step,description:pb_onboarding.step_rize_buddy
msgid "Pick the colleague who will show them the ropes. Payobook shows who is eligible and why, and puts the catch-ups in the diary."
msgstr "Pilih rekan kerja yang akan membimbing mereka. Sistem menunjukkan siapa yang memenuhi syarat dan alasannya, lalu memasukkan pertemuan rutin ke kalender."

#. module: pb_onboarding
#: model:pb.journey.template.step,name:pb_onboarding.step_rize_laptop
msgid "Laptop and equipment"
msgstr "Laptop dan perlengkapan"

#. module: pb_onboarding
#: model:pb.journey.template.step,description:pb_onboarding.step_rize_laptop
msgid "A request is raised automatically when this journey opens, and a spare is suggested before anything is bought. The machine should be on the desk and set up before they walk in."
msgstr "Permintaan diajukan otomatis saat perjalanan ini dimulai, dan perangkat cadangan disarankan sebelum membeli yang baru. Perangkat harus sudah ada di meja dan siap dipakai sebelum mereka datang."

#. module: pb_onboarding
#: model:pb.journey.template.step,name:pb_onboarding.step_rize_access
msgid "Tool access"
msgstr "Akses alat kerja"

#. module: pb_onboarding
#: model:pb.journey.template.step,description:pb_onboarding.step_rize_access
msgid "Email, chat and the systems they will use on day one. Nothing to chase on their first morning."
msgstr "Email, obrolan, dan sistem yang akan mereka pakai di hari pertama. Tidak ada yang perlu dikejar di pagi pertama mereka."

#. module: pb_onboarding
#: model:pb.journey.template.step,name:pb_onboarding.step_rize_intro_form
msgid "Tell us about you"
msgstr "Ceritakan tentang Anda"

#. module: pb_onboarding
#: model:pb.journey.template.step,description:pb_onboarding.step_rize_intro_form
msgid "A few lines from the joiner, which become the card their new team gets on day one. No login needed — the link is theirs."
msgstr "Beberapa baris dari karyawan baru, yang menjadi kartu untuk tim barunya di hari pertama. Tidak perlu masuk akun — tautannya milik mereka."

#. module: pb_onboarding
#: model:pb.journey.template.step,name:pb_onboarding.step_rize_poster
msgid "Welcome card to the team"
msgstr "Kartu sambutan untuk tim"

#. module: pb_onboarding
#: model:pb.journey.template.step,description:pb_onboarding.step_rize_poster
msgid "Sends itself on the joining day: a designed card built from their own answers, emailed to their team and nobody else."
msgstr "Terkirim otomatis di hari bergabung: kartu yang dirancang dari jawaban mereka sendiri, dikirim lewat email ke tim mereka dan tidak kepada orang lain."

#. module: pb_onboarding
#: model:pb.journey.template.step,name:pb_onboarding.step_rize_day1
msgid "Day-one introduction"
msgstr "Perkenalan hari pertama"

#. module: pb_onboarding
#: model:pb.journey.template.step,description:pb_onboarding.step_rize_day1
msgid "Sends itself on the joining day: an invitation to the manager and the joiner, with the meeting attached so it lands in both diaries."
msgstr "Terkirim otomatis di hari bergabung: undangan untuk atasan dan karyawan baru, dengan rapat terlampir agar masuk ke kalender keduanya."

#. module: pb_onboarding
#: model:pb.journey.template.step,name:pb_onboarding.step_rize_credentials
msgid "Send their sign-in details"
msgstr "Kirim detail akun masuk"

#. module: pb_onboarding
#: model:pb.journey.template.step,description:pb_onboarding.step_rize_credentials
msgid "Their account was made the day their record arrived. This is the day it is handed over — not before, so a link cannot be sitting in an inbox for three weeks."
msgstr "Akun mereka dibuat pada hari datanya masuk. Inilah hari akun diserahkan — tidak lebih awal, agar tautan tidak menganggur di kotak masuk selama tiga minggu."

#. module: pb_onboarding
#: model:pb.journey.template.step,name:pb_onboarding.step_rize_data
msgid "Finish your own details"
msgstr "Lengkapi data Anda"

#. module: pb_onboarding
#: model:pb.journey.template.step,description:pb_onboarding.step_rize_data
msgid "Bank account, emergency contact, address, documents — everything payroll needs before the first pay run. The joiner does this themselves from their own profile page."
msgstr "Rekening bank, kontak darurat, alamat, dokumen — semua yang dibutuhkan penggajian sebelum penggajian pertama. Karyawan baru mengisinya sendiri dari halaman profilnya."

#. module: pb_onboarding
#: model:pb.journey.template.step,name:pb_onboarding.step_rize_orientation
msgid "Welcome session"
msgstr "Sesi sambutan"

#. module: pb_onboarding
#: model:pb.journey.template.step,description:pb_onboarding.step_rize_orientation
msgid "They are put into the next session automatically when this journey opens. This step is the reminder that it actually happened."
msgstr "Mereka otomatis dimasukkan ke sesi berikutnya saat perjalanan ini dimulai. Langkah ini mengingatkan untuk memastikan sesi itu benar-benar terlaksana."
